    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Champions City</i> is an innovative <strong>simulation</strong> game focused on the career of an individual esports player. Create your own character, train, compete in tournaments, and rise to the top! While managing your daily life, you\u2019ll also experience <strong>social interactions</strong> like <strong>Finder, Kisstagram, and a camera feature</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS-based mini-games</strong> to improve your reflexes and aiming skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flexible training and tournament system</strong> to develop your unique playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI and  match dialogues</strong> for a realistic esports career experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your own home!</strong> Place furniture freely and personalize your gaming setup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train hard, climb the ranks, and become a legend! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Champions City</i> is an innovative <strong>simulation</strong> game focused on the career of an individual esports player. Create your own character, train, compete in tournaments, and rise to the top! While managing your daily life, you\u2019ll also experience <strong>social interactions</strong> like <strong>Finder, Kisstagram, and a camera feature</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS-based mini-games</strong> to improve your reflexes and aiming skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flexible training and tournament system</strong> to develop your unique playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI and  match dialogues</strong> for a realistic esports career experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your own home!</strong> Place furniture freely and personalize your gaming setup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train hard, climb the ranks, and become a legend! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "short_description": "Manage your own esports career in this innovative simulation game! Train, compete in tournaments, balance your social life, and become a champion! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83c\udfae",
